[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    148[0m:[38;5;10m[49m             "  exit status differs:\n    C:    {:?} (code {:?})\n    Rust: {:?} (code {:?})",
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    149[0m:[38;5;10m[49m             c.status,
